; Minimal ledger: the same October close, with two source quotes on 2026-10-31.
; Reverse quote (CNY -> AAA) comes first, forward quote (AAA -> CNY) second.
option "operating_currency" "CNY"

2026-10-01 open Assets:Broker AAA
2026-10-01 open Assets:Cash CNY
2026-10-01 open Equity:Opening-Balances CNY

2026-10-01 * "Buy 100 AAA"
  Assets:Broker   100 AAA {10.00 CNY}
  Assets:Cash   -1000 CNY

2026-10-31 price CNY 0.08 AAA
2026-10-31 price AAA 10.00 CNY
